{"3956540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Radio Decay", "steam_appid": 3956540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a soldier sent into a nuclear storm to close unusual anomalies that are emitting intense radiation and mutating bugs into monsters made of fused human corpses.  <br>Explore a dystopian urban environment solo or with up to 5 friends, working together using proximity chat to survive, scavenge gear, and extract. Fly deeper into the city unlocking more dangerous locations, and uncover the mystery of what broke the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DROP-POD INTO A NUCLEAR WASTELAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/8b5e9d0ed938b8310d5c7016ab1daa26.poster.avif?t=1780783261\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/8b5e9d0ed938b8310d5c7016ab1daa26.webm?t=1780783261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/8b5e9d0ed938b8310d5c7016ab1daa26.mp4?t=1780783261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop pod down from your airborne base into an abandoned city consumed by a radioactive storm. Scavenge for loot and use the Skyhook balloon to escape. Manage the space in your inventory to make the most of your expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stay too long you’ll be consumed by the storm, or by one of the many terrifying creatures that await you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE ANOMALIES AND BUG MONSTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/34a3c0f8559ed8ec0d74e00dc52e0063.poster.avif?t=1780783261\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/34a3c0f8559ed8ec0d74e00dc52e0063.webm?t=1780783261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/34a3c0f8559ed8ec0d74e00dc52e0063.mp4?t=1780783261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiation is spreading: Find supernatural anomalies that poison the space around them, and close them by extracting the dangerous artifacts found within. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug-like monsters have mutated in the fallout, fused with the bodies of corpses. Avoid becoming prey while collecting the resources you need to fight back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARM YOURSELF WITH NEW GEAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/99520c541c3f859c82ff1f2e3e16f0e7.poster.avif?t=1780783261\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/99520c541c3f859c82ff1f2e3e16f0e7.webm?t=1780783261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/99520c541c3f859c82ff1f2e3e16f0e7.mp4?t=1780783261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace arms and legs poisoned by radiation or dismembered by monsters with superior robotic limbs that can improve stats and grant new abilities. Find or buy guns and explosives to defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need all the equipment you can get to survive deeper in the storm as you fight towards the answers locked away at 'Ground Zero'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private Lobbies let you play solo or invite up to 5 friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh at those friends as they scream through Proximity Chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons in a cold war-era urban environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your fears to discover the quirks and weaknesses of supernatural anomalies and bug monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limbs can be lost on missions: replace them with new prosthetics that grant special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and purchase guns, explosives, and tools to fight back against the wide array of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your character’s power through artifact passives, limb stats, and inventory upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a robot companion to take control of for a second chance after your inevitable death.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a soldier sent into a nuclear storm to close unusual anomalies that are emitting intense radiation and mutating bugs into monsters made of fused human corpses.  <br>Explore a dystopian urban environment solo or with up to 5 friends, working together using proximity chat to survive, scavenge gear, and extract. Fly deeper into the city unlocking more dangerous locations, and uncover the mystery of what broke the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DROP-POD INTO A NUCLEAR WASTELAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/8b5e9d0ed938b8310d5c7016ab1daa26.poster.avif?t=1780783261\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956540/extras/8b5e9d0ed938b8310d5c7016ab1daa26.webm?t=1780783261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\